      "content": "but eating carbs will make it go higher!! that's why i want the insulin, to bring it down. i'm literally shaking so hard i can barely hold my phone and the numbness in my arm is getting weird. like, if i was just high, wouldn't i feel more energetic or something? instead i feel like i'm fading out. if i just take 5 units now, it'll fix the 310 and then i can just sleep it off, right? please, i really can't go to the er right now, just tell me if the 5 units is okay to do.",
